{"synopsis":"“Aku hanya ingin hidup sebagai karakter ekstra dalam novel ini. Sampai sang tokoh utama mati. Kini aku mendapat kesempatan kedua — saatnya aku yang bergerak.”\n\nCerita ini menyelami kehidupan Kim Seon-woo, yang terseret masuk ke dalam sebuah novel terkenal dan memutuskan untuk menjalani hidup tenang sebagai karakter sampingan. Suatu hari, sang tokoh utama dalam novel tersebut meninggal…\n\n“…Kau pikir aku akan percaya itu?”\n\nIa akhirnya kembali ke masa lalu—kembali ke hari pertamanya berada di dalam novel.","alternative_title":"회귀한 엑스트라가 천재가 됨","author":"Texgol","artist":"Studio Sigma","chapters":[{"number":"52","chapter":"52","slug":"76496b9c-7686-473c-82a2-d27d4cac17a1","date":"2026-07-10","images":[]},{"number":"51","chapter":"51","slug":"d1c7910f-1caf-45c7-bd76-8db4d7488194","date":"2026-07-03","images":[]},{"number":"50","chapter":"50","slug":"c9e3a39e-dbea-49fa-9878-80e3e9368ca9","date":"2026-06-26","images":[]},{"number":"49","chapter":"49","slug":"9a5123e6-1e93-4e9e-ad61-a40aec1b8163","date":"2026-06-19","images":[]},{"number":"48","chapter":"48","slug":"ceedf554-7cdb-4540-906c-ed90aa35cf25","date":"2026-06-12","images":[]},{"number":"47","chapter":"47","slug":"34ca4e12-f511-4d88-aa24-8194e57148d2","date":"2026-06-06","images":[]},{"number":"46","chapter":"46","slug":"8c6ede02-4f58-470b-a646-b61b26a83122","date":"2026-05-29","images":[]},{"number":"45","chapter":"45","slug":"9a5b24ef-0c63-4df4-9e37-bcb18bb79a79","date":"2026-05-22","images":[]},{"number":"44","chapter":"44","slug":"e722be40-13cf-4349-99ee-30df77566100","date":"2026-05-15","images":[]},{"number":"43","chapter":"43","slug":"51f77daf-dca3-4aa5-8036-e1fbf6082f4b","date":"2026-05-08","images":[]},{"number":"42","chapter":"42","slug":"635efacb-1be6-48ba-98f6-fd2912150d7c","date":"2026-05-01","images":[]},{"number":"41","chapter":"41","slug":"452de12e-071f-4efb-a7d6-27d1e8177b0f","date":"2026-04-24","images":[]},{"number":"40","chapter":"40","slug":"aacccdbf-3b64-4375-9308-2c299c9fa